          "In practical production workflows, a travel vlogger can produce custom cinematic scores matching scenic transitions, a game designer can prototype interactive ambient soundtrack themes for level testing, and a podcast producer can establish distinct intro and outro sonic branding—all without incurring licensing costs.",
