          "Text Prompt Guidance: Many free platforms allow you to add a text prompt alongside the image to steer the animation style and direction. For example, 'cinematic, slow motion, golden hour' can turn a simple photo into a dramatic clip. This feature gives you creative control without needing complex timeline editing.",
          "Free Daily Credits / Quota: The best free tools replenish a set number of credits each day, so you can generate a small batch of videos consistently. Pika Labs offers 250 free credits per day, while Luma Dream Machine provides 5 free generations daily. These quotas are ideal for regular social media posting without paying.",
