          "Export Quality & Resolution: Free plans usually cap exports at 480p or 720p with noticeable compression artifacts. Watermark overlays are common, but you can often crop them out if you keep the face centered.",
          "Processing Speed: Cloud-based free tools queue your job with other users, so you might wait several minutes for a 15-second clip. Paid plans prioritize processing and offer near-real-time results.",
          "Daily Swap Limit: Most free accounts allow only 1 to 5 face swaps per day. This is fine for casual use but restrictive if you need to produce multiple variations in a single session.",
          "Template Library: Tools like Reface offer hundreds of pre-made templates (movie scenes, viral memes) and allow you to swap faces freely. Others require you to upload your own video, giving more control but less inspiration.",
