          "AI voice‑over with multiple languages: Most tools include a text‑to‑speech engine offering natural‑sounding voices, often in English, Spanish, French, German, and more. You can choose gender, accent, and even adjust speed—excellent for creating channel trailers or tutorials without recording your own voice.",
