          "Real‑world scenarios where free AI browsers excel include academic research: a student can open a dozen tabs with scientific papers, then use Edge Copilot to summarize each one into a comparison table. A freelance writer can draft multiple pitches using Opera Aria’s chat, then refine tone and style with its rewrite feature. A developer can use Brave Leo to quickly understand unfamiliar code snippets on GitHub without leaving the page. In each case, the free tier handles the core need — speed, privacy, and contextual assistance — without forcing an upgrade. Only when you need bulk image generation, deep document analysis (100+ pages), or premium model access (e.g., GPT‑4 Turbo with vision) should you consider a paid plan."
